# The operating system layer: the flight code's lint (../.clang-tidy) less one check.
#
# The sockets API takes a `sockaddr*` and is handed a `sockaddr_in`: bind, sendto and recvfrom cannot be called
# without a reinterpret_cast, on Windows or on Linux. This directory is where the OS's C interfaces are met so
# that nothing above it has to; the check stays on everywhere else.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: '-cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-reinterpret-cast'
